    "title": "OBOOK Holdings Flags OwlPay Harbor Hit $130m Annualised volume",
    "summary": "OBOOK says its digital currency cross-border payments platform reached $130m in annualised run-rate volume, though H1 2026 revenue came in at under $4m.\nThe post OBOOK Holdings Flags OwlPay Harbor Hit $130m Annualised volume appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://thefintechtimes.com/obook-holdings-flags-owlpay-harbor-hit-130m-annualised-volume/",
    "source": "The Fintech Times",
    "tags": [
